{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n方智弘（Oscar）與何沛珈（Roxanne）在《女神配對計劃 2》中甜度爆錶！繼早前監製在直播中踢爆後，Oscar被發現一直戴著Roxanne借出的橡筋，更發表「有借冇還」的甜蜜宣言，曖昧指數急升！眼利網民更化身偵探找出證據，令二人獲封「橡筋 CP」，究竟這條「定情橡筋」背後有何故事？\n</p>\n<h2>Oscar怕醜發表愛宣言：條橡筋有借冇還</h2>\n<p>在昨晚播出的單獨約會中，Oscar與Roxanne揭開了一個甜蜜小秘密。原來，自從Roxanne在海洋館過夜時，借了一條橡筋給Oscar紮頭髮後，Oscar便一直將這條橡筋戴在手上。約會期間，Oscar更摸著鼻子、怕怕醜醜地向Roxanne講明：「我唔畀番你架，唔還架喇，有借冇還！」這個猶如偶像劇般的宣言，瞬間讓曖昧氣氛升至頂點，盡顯二人之間的特殊情愫。</p>\n<h2>監製直播踢爆甜蜜秘密 網民化身偵探翻出證據</h2>\n<p>這條「定情橡筋」的秘密，最早是由節目監製在上周的直播中無意踢爆。事件曝光後，立即引起網民熱烈討論，更有眼利網民化身偵探，翻出Oscar近期上載到社交平台的照片。網民發現，在多張照片中，Oscar的右手手腕都明顯戴著一條黑色橡筋，與Roxanne借出的款式不謀而合。這個發現猶如實質證據，證明Oscar以實際行動將Roxanne「掛在身上」，甜蜜舉動閃瞎一眾網民。</p>\n<h2>網民封二人「橡筋CP」 激讚夠真誠勁有Feel</h2>\n<p>因為這條充滿故事的橡筋，Oscar與Roxanne被網民封為「橡筋 CP」，大讚二人互動夠真誠、夠甜蜜。網民紛紛留言表示：「原來條橡筋別有用心，Sweet」、「好有 Feel、好真」、「兩個對話很真誠，非常夾的一對」、「好鍾意佢哋嘅坦白」、「睇得出 Oscar 好在意 Roxanne」、「有拍拖感覺。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5101860026b03c2cf49838.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5101860026b03c2cf49838.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_2673809586b03c32139034.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_2673809586b03c32139034.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21079552046b03c328b2d6c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_21079552046b03c328b2d6c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_1496021586b03c3433238f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_1496021586b03c3433238f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21e_4600688376b03c34be4c50.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21e_4600688376b03c34be4c50.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21d_5018242756b03c35725fd9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21d_5018242756b03c35725fd9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21c_9484333976b03c360a8563.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21c_9484333976b03c360a8563.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21b_19318579226b03c36b4734b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21b_19318579226b03c36b4734b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21a_13674093736b03c37380b72.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21a_13674093736b03c37380b72.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_2314654836b03c37e3ab5d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_2314654836b03c37e3ab5d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:52:16.264947+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1049,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:30:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:06:00.646015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:45:40.079868+00:00","content_hash":"8a633f6973fb5578e6629ca27a77c41236297701da17ad14f643af10bebff54a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}